title: RULSafe
message: Please cite this software if you use it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: RULSafe contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
repository-code: https://github.com/roshandhanasekaran/rulsafe
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Completed-trajectory remaining-useful-life checks for v0.1, with causal
  windows, train-only preprocessing, and an audit that reports censored or
  unsupported histories instead of dropping them. Requires Python 3.11 or
  newer. C-MAPSS FD001 is the demo. SCANIA Component X is deferred to v0.2.
